1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,870
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,110
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:05,240
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:09,810
I'm the owner of 5.5 percent
of Adele Group's shares,

5
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,080
major shareholder Moon Tae Jin.

6
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:16,020
- What?
- Her?

7
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,290
- She's Moon Tae Jin?
- Moon Tae Jin?

8
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:21,690
What?

9
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:24,660
Butler Ok is the major shareholder?

10
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,570
Wait. How can you be Moon Tae Jin?

11
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:32,600
After all the crazy things I did
to find Moon Tae Jin...

12
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,310
You're telling me you were right
under my nose the whole time?

13
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:40,480
Yes, and watching you
has been pretty entertaining.

14
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:44,180
You... Who in the world are you?

15
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:47,150
What was your motive
for sneaking into my home?

16
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:49,690
Before we get to that,

17
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:51,990
let's settle the matter
of appointing the chairman first.

18
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:57,800
If former President Kim Dan Hui
withdrew her candidacy for chairman,

19
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,060
I'll exercise my right
as a major shareholder...

20
00:01:00,770 --> 00:01:02,370
under the bylaws'
exception clause...

21
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:07,940
to nominate Ms. Baek Jin Ju
as a candidate for chairman.

22
00:01:08,340 --> 00:01:10,310
Wait, what?

23
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:16,050
This is ridiculous.

24
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:18,680
The major shareholder
is nominating her?

25
00:01:20,550 --> 00:01:23,690
A chairman candidate?
Absolutely not!

26
00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:25,160
Ms. Baek Jin Ju.

27
00:01:25,690 --> 00:01:27,130
Are you ready to run for chairman...

28
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:31,530
and compete
against Director Park Hyun Jun?

29
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,440
Yes.

30
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:50,720
I'll compete for the chairmanship
as a candidate.

31
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:52,420
Baek Jin Ju...

32
00:02:11,140 --> 00:02:12,940
Dan Hui, it's okay. Just hold tight.

33
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:14,710
Dan Hui, get away from the door.

34
00:02:15,110 --> 00:02:16,110
Stay clear!

35
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:19,540
Yoon Jung.

36
00:02:20,250 --> 00:02:21,950
Are you okay?

37
00:02:22,210 --> 00:02:25,580
Mr. Park! Careful! Be gentle.

38
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:27,420
Please take Min Jun to the hospital.

39
00:02:27,420 --> 00:02:29,420
Yes, we'll head there right away.

40
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:31,720
You two, please hurry
to the boardroom.

41
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:35,830
Yes, Mother, I'm okay.
You should go.

42
00:02:36,490 --> 00:02:38,830
Hurry. Jin Ju will have a hard time
on her own.

43
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,170
Okay.

44
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,670
Please take care of Min Jun.

45
00:02:43,770 --> 00:02:48,370
- Don't worry. Hurry and go.
- Right. Let's go.

46
00:02:54,350 --> 00:02:55,410
Are you okay?

47
00:02:55,810 --> 00:02:56,810
Yes.

48
00:02:57,350 --> 00:02:58,350
We should get to the hospital.

49
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:01,920
(Regular Board Meeting,
Next Chairman Selection)

50
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:04,490
Baek Jin Ju as the chairman
of Adele Group?

51
00:03:05,490 --> 00:03:06,820
Just because you have some stock,

52
00:03:06,890 --> 00:03:08,890
you think you can pull
something this ridiculous?

53
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:11,230
Since the board
couldn't reach a conclusion,

54
00:03:11,230 --> 00:03:13,230
whether this is absurd
will be decided...

55
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,670
at the special
shareholders' meeting.

56
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:20,070
You definitely have
an ulterior motive.

57
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:24,610
That's why you infiltrated my house.
To quietly accumulate stock.

58
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:29,750
Yes. Tell me
what you're really up to.

59
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:37,060
Before that, you answer me first.

60
00:03:38,460 --> 00:03:41,290
What did you do
to force President Kim to withdraw?

61
00:03:45,130 --> 00:03:46,130
Park Tae Ho!

62
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Ms. Kim.

63
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:50,400
You made a mistake today.

64
00:03:51,340 --> 00:03:54,470
To make Park Hyun Jun the chairman,
you hurt your own son.

65
00:03:55,170 --> 00:03:57,480
How dare you take Min Jun hostage
and assault him?

66
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:58,740
He was assaulted?

67
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:03,350
From this moment on, Park Tae Ho,

68
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:05,580
you no longer have a son.

69
00:04:06,150 --> 00:04:08,590
The bloodline and family ties
you hold so dear?

70
00:04:09,590 --> 00:04:10,920
You've severed them
with your own two hands.

71
00:04:14,860 --> 00:04:17,630
You think Park Min Jun is
my only son?

72
00:04:19,930 --> 00:04:21,030
I have...

73
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:24,170
another son right here.

74
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:29,140
The chairmanship of Adele Group...

75
00:04:29,670 --> 00:04:31,810
will go to my son,
my own flesh and blood.

76
00:04:32,210 --> 00:04:35,550
To the likes of you and Baek Jin Ju
who aren't even qualified,

77
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,620
I'll never hand it over.

78
00:04:40,390 --> 00:04:41,390
Unworthy?

79
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:46,420
Bloodline?

80
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:52,960
Fine.

81
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:57,300
Let's see you try selling your son,
Park Hyun Jun,

82
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:58,740
as your successor.

83
00:05:01,410 --> 00:05:03,340
It looks like you're done talking,
so let's go.

84
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:08,310
What's the point of arguing here?
Come on, hurry up.

85
00:05:08,410 --> 00:05:10,280
- Let's go.
- I'm coming.

86
00:05:12,050 --> 00:05:13,050
Park Hyun Jun.

87
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:15,150
Choi Yu Na.

88
00:05:15,390 --> 00:05:17,660
You two should know
what shame feels like.

89
00:05:18,090 --> 00:05:20,730
Think carefully
about what you're doing...

90
00:05:21,860 --> 00:05:22,890
by Park Tae Ho's side.

91
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,170
You.

92
00:05:27,830 --> 00:05:29,170
Were you part
of Park Tae Ho's plan...

93
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:31,340
to assault and imprison Min Jun?

94
00:05:31,670 --> 00:05:34,140
That's right.
From right by the chairman's side,

95
00:05:34,470 --> 00:05:36,240
I'm going to put Hyun Jun
in that seat.

96
00:05:36,870 --> 00:05:39,740
Assault, imprisonment, you name it.

97
00:05:40,580 --> 00:05:42,650
I'll do whatever it takes,

98
00:05:43,580 --> 00:05:44,580
so count on it.

99
00:05:44,580 --> 00:05:46,750
Becoming just like Park Tae Ho...

100
00:05:47,790 --> 00:05:49,250
is something
you'll definitely come to regret.

101
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:51,620
Really?

102
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:55,630
We'll have to wait and see
who ends up with regrets.

103
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:02,070
(Regular Board Meeting,
Next Chairman Selection)

104
00:06:03,470 --> 00:06:05,140
Jin Ju, are you okay?

105
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:06,840
Yes, I'm fine.

106
00:06:07,410 --> 00:06:08,510
What about Min Jun?

107
00:06:08,710 --> 00:06:09,740
He went to see a doctor.

108
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:14,810
By the way, what happened
with the chairman election?

109
00:06:15,410 --> 00:06:17,850
It didn't seem like
they decided on Park Hyun Jun.

110
00:06:18,350 --> 00:06:19,420
Fortunately,

111
00:06:20,150 --> 00:06:23,220
we got a chance thanks to Butler Ok.

112
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:25,360
Butler Ok?

113
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:34,530
Mrs. Ok, what are you doing here?

114
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,500
Mrs. Ok...

115
00:06:37,670 --> 00:06:39,100
is the major shareholder,

116
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,340
Moon Tae Jin.

117
00:06:41,610 --> 00:06:42,610
What?

118
00:06:52,450 --> 00:06:54,690
(Munhwadang)

119
00:07:00,590 --> 00:07:02,030
This was Moon Hyeon Bo,

120
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:06,460
the late owner of Munhwadang
and father-in-law to Park Tae Ho.

121
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:09,730
Then you two...

122
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:11,840
That's right.

123
00:07:11,970 --> 00:07:16,870
Ms. Moon and I are connected
through Munhwadang.

124
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:20,210
The elder of Munhwadang
was a distant relative of mine...

125
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,880
and was like a father to me.

126
00:07:22,010 --> 00:07:23,750
After I lost my parents
at a young age,

127
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:25,980
he sent me to study in the US...

128
00:07:26,150 --> 00:07:28,290
and looked after me
as if I were his own.

129
00:07:28,450 --> 00:07:33,020
Right before he passed away,
he made a final request.

130
00:07:34,790 --> 00:07:36,990
He asked me to reclaim Munhwadang,

131
00:07:37,060 --> 00:07:39,460
which had been stolen
by Park Tae Ho.

132
00:07:39,530 --> 00:07:42,730
He asked the same thing of me.

133
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:44,300
He secretly entrusted
his land to me,

134
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:45,800
out of Park Tae Ho's reach,

135
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:49,670
and asked me to help Ms. Moon.

136
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:54,210
That's why Ms. Moon and I started
buying up shares in Adele Group,

137
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:57,680
waiting for the day
we could bring Park Tae Ho down.

138
00:08:07,290 --> 00:08:08,290
Wait.

139
00:08:08,730 --> 00:08:11,560
How can Butler Ok be
the major shareholder, Moon Tae Jin?

140
00:08:12,130 --> 00:08:16,030
Imagine the fortune she has.
Why would she live as a housekeeper?

141
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,400
Why our house of all places?

142
00:08:20,170 --> 00:08:21,540
I think that's
what's important here.

143
00:08:21,770 --> 00:08:22,770
No.

144
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:26,210
We need to know why she sided
with Kim Dan Hui and Baek Jin Ju.

145
00:08:26,580 --> 00:08:28,010
By siding with them,

146
00:08:28,010 --> 00:08:30,680
she's meddling
in Adele Group's succession.

147
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:38,020
Mrs. Han.

148
00:08:38,090 --> 00:08:40,760
What was your relationship
with the owner of Munhwadang?

149
00:08:40,830 --> 00:08:44,230
I also owe a great debt to Mr. Moon.

150
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:47,770
This place had been reduced
to ashes by a fire,

151
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:50,870
and he was the one
who helped rebuild it.

152
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,410
I couldn't just turn a blind eye...

153
00:08:55,170 --> 00:08:56,840
to the injustice
my benefactor suffered.

154
00:08:57,980 --> 00:08:59,010
Park Tae Ho.

155
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:02,850
Just how many people's lives
has he ruined?

156
00:09:03,210 --> 00:09:05,880
His terrible greed and evil deeds...

157
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:08,250
will come to an end.

158
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:11,160
After all,
so many people are working...

159
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:14,160
to bring Park Tae Ho to justice.

160
00:09:15,130 --> 00:09:18,160
Then, your inviting me
to Ihwachae...

161
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,700
Was that part of your plan?

162
00:09:21,430 --> 00:09:22,870
Why me, of all people?

163
00:09:23,070 --> 00:09:26,000
At first,
we just planned to use you.

164
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:29,610
But the more I got to know you,

165
00:09:29,810 --> 00:09:31,210
the more I grew to care for you.

166
00:09:31,540 --> 00:09:36,410
I knew it
from the moment we first met.

167
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:42,320
You really are one of a kind,
Director Kim.

168
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,350
Pardon me?

169
00:09:43,350 --> 00:09:46,960
I've seen plenty of parents...

170
00:09:47,090 --> 00:09:51,230
use their kids' marriages
for their own ambitions.

171
00:09:51,530 --> 00:09:52,830
So when I meet...

172
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:56,600
someone like you
who thinks differently,

173
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:59,700
I feel compelled to help
however I can.

174
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:04,440
I could tell you were a good person
from our first meeting.

175
00:10:05,510 --> 00:10:08,080
As I spent more time with you,

176
00:10:08,410 --> 00:10:11,180
I came to believe
you were someone I could trust.

177
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:17,220
You still won't say it?

178
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:20,160
Fine. Go on, keep it up.

179
00:10:20,990 --> 00:10:23,690
I'll keep slapping Butler Ok
until her cheek is raw.

180
00:10:24,330 --> 00:10:25,330
Stop.

181
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,530
Please stop, ma'am.

182
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:36,340
I felt that we could walk
this difficult path together.

183
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:41,250
It seems your kindness
is being repaid.

184
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:45,350
That's right. From now on,

185
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:49,650
we'll be your pillar of support.

186
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:52,420
If we work together, I'm sure...

187
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:55,290
we can make Park Tae Ho pay
for what he's done.

188
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,160
Right.

189
00:10:58,900 --> 00:11:00,260
I know it's shameless of me,

190
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:03,300
but I'll accept your help.

191
00:11:04,370 --> 00:11:06,670
I'll take down Park Tae Ho...

192
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:08,740
and bring justice to the victims...

193
00:11:08,810 --> 00:11:11,010
who died at his hands.

194
00:11:22,490 --> 00:11:23,550
Unbelievable!

195
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:26,360
Don't just stand here chatting.

196
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:28,860
Go find out about Moon Tae Jin!

197
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,860
It'll be hard to find
any specific information.

198
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:35,770
I looked into Moon Tae Jin
before the board meeting,

199
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:37,770
but I didn't find much.

200
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,310
We need some solid information.

201
00:11:43,810 --> 00:11:45,210
You said you lived with her
for years.

202
00:11:45,210 --> 00:11:46,540
Was there nothing suspicious?

203
00:11:46,610 --> 00:11:48,210
Even if we spent years together,

204
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:51,120
a lady of the house
and a housekeeper don't exactly mix.

205
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:55,450
Driver Song was closer to her
than I was.

206
00:11:55,450 --> 00:11:56,690
- We can ask him.
- Right.

207
00:11:56,820 --> 00:11:58,890
Driver Song!

208
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,690
Yes, sir. Right here.

209
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:05,930
You.

210
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,570
I heard you and Butler Ok
were close.

211
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:09,800
What?

212
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:12,870
Well, I guess.

213
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:15,440
Tell me everything
you know about her.

214
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:17,170
Was there anything suspicious
about her?

215
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,580
Anything suspicious?

216
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:21,210
Well, not really.

217
00:12:21,850 --> 00:12:23,910
Why are you suddenly
asking about her?

218
00:12:24,780 --> 00:12:25,950
Did something happen?

219
00:12:25,980 --> 00:12:28,150
Just answer the question!

220
00:12:32,090 --> 00:12:33,120
Oh Jung Ran.

221
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:36,030
Find out everything you can
about Moon Tae Jin.

222
00:12:36,230 --> 00:12:38,300
And bring it to me. Got it?

223
00:12:39,130 --> 00:12:40,160
And you.

224
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:43,030
You must become the chairman
no matter what,

225
00:12:43,100 --> 00:12:45,040
so get yourself together.

226
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,710
If you let Baek Jin Ju
make you waver,

227
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:50,340
you'll die by my hand.

228
00:12:52,110 --> 00:12:54,350
What are you talking about?

229
00:12:54,580 --> 00:12:58,180
Hyun Jun and Baek Jin Ju
have been enemies for ages.

230
00:12:59,180 --> 00:13:00,220
Sure.

231
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:02,220
I have no intention of losing,

232
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,460
so don't worry.

233
00:13:04,460 --> 00:13:05,690
Good.

234
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,860
The major shareholder's support
doesn't give her an advantage.

235
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:11,330
Got it? Just secure more shares...

236
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:13,460
by the shareholders' meeting.

237
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:17,000
Why are you still standing there?

238
00:13:31,250 --> 00:13:32,620
Hyun Jun.

239
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:44,430
Hyun Jun, wait.

240
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:45,500
Hyun Jun.

241
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:46,800
Hyun Jun, please.

242
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:49,000
The situation has changed,
hasn't it?

243
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:51,570
Are you now competing
with Baek Jin Ju...

244
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,770
for the chairman position?

245
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,270
What are you getting at?

246
00:13:57,710 --> 00:14:00,110
I know being chairman is a big deal,

247
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:03,780
but it's not worth
ruining yourself over.

248
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:05,020
So?

249
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:07,420
If I give up on being chairman,
I'll be fine?

250
00:14:08,150 --> 00:14:11,060
Living a life like yours,
getting kicked around,

251
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,760
is that what you call being fine?

252
00:14:15,130 --> 00:14:16,360
You're a nobody,

253
00:14:17,090 --> 00:14:18,460
so stay out of it.

254
00:14:34,550 --> 00:14:35,610
It's all...

255
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:38,980
It's because I'm a failure
that Hyun Jun is like this.

256
00:14:42,350 --> 00:14:43,420
My Hyun Jun...

257
00:14:44,390 --> 00:14:46,460
I can't let him be ruined
any further.

258
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:52,360
Thanks to Butler Ok and Mrs. Han,
we averted the crisis,

259
00:14:53,300 --> 00:14:56,130
but it's placed a huge burden
on you, Jin Ju.

260
00:14:57,300 --> 00:14:58,300
I'm sorry.

261
00:14:58,700 --> 00:14:59,770
Don't be.

262
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,310
If anything,

263
00:15:01,740 --> 00:15:04,070
I'm the one who's worried
if it's right for me...

264
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:06,740
to become chairman instead of you.

265
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:12,150
We're a team.

266
00:15:12,350 --> 00:15:14,720
Even when Park Tae Ho
was holding me captive,

267
00:15:15,090 --> 00:15:17,350
I was glad we at least had you
at the meeting.

268
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:20,660
If you're okay with it,
on behalf of all of us,

269
00:15:21,030 --> 00:15:22,490
please become the chairman.

270
00:15:26,100 --> 00:15:28,900
Got it. I'll make sure
to prepare thoroughly.

271
00:15:32,370 --> 00:15:33,400
There you go.

272
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:35,110
Min Jun.

273
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:39,580
- All right, careful now.
- Are you okay?

274
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:42,510
Here, let's get you seated.

275
00:15:43,250 --> 00:15:44,250
There.

276
00:15:47,950 --> 00:15:48,950
I'm okay.

277
00:15:49,490 --> 00:15:52,090
Nothing's broken.
I'll be better in no time.

278
00:15:52,420 --> 00:15:54,930
Still, he has severe bruises
and muscle damage,

279
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:56,960
so he needs to rest
for the time being.

280
00:15:57,630 --> 00:15:58,630
Park Tae Ho...

281
00:15:58,860 --> 00:16:01,470
How could he do this to his own son?

282
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,230
He's ready to walk away
from his child,

283
00:16:04,370 --> 00:16:06,640
but not from Adele Group.

284
00:16:08,010 --> 00:16:10,370
He still thinks of Park Hyun Jun
as his son,

285
00:16:10,370 --> 00:16:11,640
which is why he'd go this far.

286
00:16:11,710 --> 00:16:13,280
Did you get the injury report?

287
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:14,710
We need to go to the police first.

288
00:16:15,550 --> 00:16:18,480
While I was at the hospital,
I had the legal team look into it,

289
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,680
but there's no evidence left
to prove the assault.

290
00:16:21,050 --> 00:16:22,120
Even if we file a report,

291
00:16:22,390 --> 00:16:23,790
it'd be difficult to press charges.

292
00:16:25,290 --> 00:16:26,720
Park Tae Ho and Choi Yu Na said...

293
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,430
they tied up loose ends.

294
00:16:28,730 --> 00:16:30,730
Park Tae Ho, Choi Yu Na.

295
00:16:31,930 --> 00:16:34,100
We can't just let Park Tae Ho be.

296
00:16:34,570 --> 00:16:35,870
I know. I'm sure...

297
00:16:35,970 --> 00:16:38,040
he'll try to pull something
at the shareholders' meeting.

298
00:16:38,140 --> 00:16:41,370
He might even do something
that puts Jin Ju in danger.

299
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:45,410
That's right.
Before the shareholders' meeting,

300
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:47,540
we need to tie Park Tae Ho's hands.

301
00:16:57,150 --> 00:17:00,520
Please leave the investigation
into Moon Tae Jin to me.

302
00:17:01,390 --> 00:17:02,560
Moon Tae Jin...

303
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:05,360
She's worked in this house
for decades.

304
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:07,100
After laying low for so long,

305
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,730
she's meddling
in the chairman election,

306
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,340
backing Kim Dan Hui and Baek Jin Ju?

307
00:17:14,340 --> 00:17:17,740
She must be after the Adele Group.

308
00:17:18,610 --> 00:17:21,040
I need to prepare
for the shareholders' meeting.

309
00:17:22,150 --> 00:17:24,850
Wouldn't I be better at it
than Ms. Oh?

310
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:28,620
What?

311
00:17:30,090 --> 00:17:31,860
Look, forget the investigation.

312
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,630
You need to start preparing
for the shareholders' meeting.

313
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:35,760
Follow me.

314
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,640
You sick murderer!

315
00:17:50,470 --> 00:17:52,740
How dare you crawl in here?

316
00:17:52,980 --> 00:17:54,980
Just because I couldn't
report you to the police...

317
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:57,080
doesn't mean your crime is erased.

318
00:17:57,210 --> 00:17:59,420
How dare you set foot in this house?

319
00:18:01,150 --> 00:18:04,150
I don't plan on staying long,
all right?

320
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,720
Ms. Choi.

321
00:18:09,390 --> 00:18:12,560
Just sign here.
Then we'll leave right away.

322
00:18:15,730 --> 00:18:17,500
A stock transfer agreement?

323
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:19,440
Mom, you don't need Dad's shares.

324
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:21,810
If you hand over
the shares he gave you...

325
00:18:21,810 --> 00:18:23,110
before going in for questioning...

326
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:25,340
You absolute scum!

327
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:27,040
Mom!

328
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:30,910
Let go. You despicable trash.

329
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:32,880
Are you even human?

330
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:35,220
You killed Yu Na's dad,

331
00:18:35,290 --> 00:18:38,620
and now you're using her
to snatch up his shares too?

332
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:41,760
So you're not completely clueless
after all.

333
00:18:41,830 --> 00:18:43,530
Since you get it, sign the papers!

334
00:18:44,530 --> 00:18:46,100
First your husband,
then your daughter.

335
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:47,870
Do you really want
to lose them both?

336
00:18:48,830 --> 00:18:49,830
Sir?

337
00:18:49,930 --> 00:18:51,870
Never have I seen
such a vile monster.

338
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:55,570
Fine. Today, it's you or me.

339
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:57,810
I'll finally bring justice
to Yu Na's dad...

340
00:18:58,010 --> 00:18:59,940
for his wrongful death.

341
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:03,750
Get over here.
I'm going to rip out your guts...

342
00:19:04,210 --> 00:19:07,650
and chew them up. Park Tae Ho!

343
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:11,220
Come on. Seriously?

344
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:12,620
Sir...

345
00:19:14,930 --> 00:19:15,930
Yu Na!

346
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:19,160
You still don't get the situation,
do you?

347
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:22,970
You have no idea
who you're dealing with.

348
00:19:23,730 --> 00:19:26,370
Did you really think
I'd give you our shares...

349
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:28,610
just because you threatened me?

350
00:19:28,670 --> 00:19:30,710
If you so much as touch Yu Na,

351
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:32,240
I'll go to Jin Ju...

352
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:34,610
and hand over every last one
of these shares to her.

353
00:19:34,910 --> 00:19:37,980
What the... Darn it!

354
00:19:40,850 --> 00:19:41,920
Choi Yu Na!

355
00:19:42,820 --> 00:19:44,760
Come back with the shares.

356
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:46,320
If you fail,

357
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:48,890
don't you dare set foot
in my house again.

358
00:19:49,930 --> 00:19:51,900
- Darn.
- Let go of me!

359
00:19:52,700 --> 00:19:54,060
Absolute scum!

360
00:19:54,730 --> 00:19:55,730
My gosh.

361
00:19:56,830 --> 00:20:00,040
My gosh, you foolish girl.
You idiot.

362
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,710
You complete fool.

363
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:05,880
Did you abandon your parents
just to be treated like this?

364
00:20:06,910 --> 00:20:09,650
You could've at least made
a good life for yourself.

365
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:13,180
What is this?
Look at the state you're in.

366
00:20:13,620 --> 00:20:15,490
That's why you have to help me, Mom.

367
00:20:16,050 --> 00:20:18,820
For Hyun Jun to become chairman,
he needs Dad's shares.

368
00:20:18,990 --> 00:20:21,390
It's the only way I can live
as a member of the Adele family.

369
00:20:21,460 --> 00:20:24,960
Oh, what am I going to do with you?

370
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:27,530
Goodness me.

371
00:20:30,230 --> 00:20:32,840
You foolish girl!

372
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:43,780
I know being chairman is a big deal,

373
00:20:44,310 --> 00:20:47,280
but it's not worth
ruining yourself over.

374
00:20:49,620 --> 00:20:51,290
Chairman of the great...

375
00:20:52,290 --> 00:20:53,460
Adele Group.

376
00:20:56,590 --> 00:20:59,660
I'll compete for the chairmanship
as a candidate.

377
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:05,040
You could've finished me
by exposing my secret,

378
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:06,140
but you chose to compete instead.

379
00:21:09,010 --> 00:21:10,940
What on earth are you thinking?

380
00:21:16,750 --> 00:21:19,820
Ms. Kim has a strategy
to handle Park Tae Ho,

381
00:21:20,080 --> 00:21:22,350
so let's prepare
for the shareholders' meeting.

382
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:25,560
Right. I've already asked
the intel team to run a comparison.

383
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:27,860
While Moon Tae Jin's stake
is substantial,

384
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:29,490
we can't let our guard down.

385
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:31,630
Choi Yu Na's shares, in particular,

386
00:21:31,700 --> 00:21:32,900
are going to be a problem.

387
00:21:33,130 --> 00:21:35,430
- Choi Yu Na's shares?
- Yes.

388
00:21:36,070 --> 00:21:38,040
We've frozen them
under provisional seizure,

389
00:21:38,170 --> 00:21:39,640
but she can still exercise
her voting rights.

390
00:21:39,700 --> 00:21:43,640
Before CEO Choi Sam Sik passed away,
he'd gifted them to his spouse.

391
00:21:43,870 --> 00:21:47,640
Choi Yu Na will try to get her hands
on those shares one way or another.

392
00:21:48,380 --> 00:21:51,380
Then we'll have the advantage
if we get those shares.

393
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:54,080
I'll go to Choi Yu Na's house
and check on it.

394
00:21:56,550 --> 00:21:58,360
(Incoming call: Park Hyun Jun)

395
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:22,350
Are you going to stay...

396
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:25,080
in the race for chairman?

397
00:22:25,350 --> 00:22:26,420
Yes.

398
00:22:27,150 --> 00:22:30,290
I can't back down now,
for everyone's sake.

399
00:22:30,420 --> 00:22:32,960
Then you should've exposed my secret
at the board meeting.

400
00:22:33,260 --> 00:22:35,790
You had the chance to end it.
What are you waiting for?

401
00:22:37,560 --> 00:22:39,630
Are you playing games with me?
Oh, I get it.

402
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:43,000
Are you pitying me
because I'm so pathetic?

403
00:22:44,740 --> 00:22:47,170
It's because I don't want to be
like Park Tae Ho.

404
00:22:48,110 --> 00:22:49,810
If I were to take
the chairman's seat...

405
00:22:50,010 --> 00:22:51,710
by shattering your life,

406
00:22:52,380 --> 00:22:53,740
I'd be no different
from Park Tae Ho,

407
00:22:53,940 --> 00:22:57,850
who assaults his own son, Min Jun,
all to keep that position.

408
00:22:59,250 --> 00:23:00,250
Are you saying that...

409
00:23:01,080 --> 00:23:03,150
standing here next
to Chairman Park...

410
00:23:04,350 --> 00:23:06,090
makes me just like him?

411
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:08,330
I believe you're not like him yet.

412
00:23:08,930 --> 00:23:11,430
But as the race for chairman
heats up,

413
00:23:12,030 --> 00:23:13,730
you could turn into him
at any second.

414
00:23:14,900 --> 00:23:16,230
If it comes to that,

415
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:18,970
you should be the one to quit.

416
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:23,610
What ruins your life
may not be your secret,

417
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:25,840
but your choices.

418
00:23:31,410 --> 00:23:32,920
Do you think my life
can return to normal...

419
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:36,450
if I give up the chairmanship?

420
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:42,530
I'm completely backed
into a corner, too.

421
00:23:42,730 --> 00:23:43,890
Even if it's you,

422
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:45,900
and regardless
of how much I loved you,

423
00:23:48,300 --> 00:23:50,630
I'm the kind of man
who puts saving his own skin first.

424
00:23:52,700 --> 00:23:55,770
I don't care if I become
just like Chairman Park.

425
00:23:57,370 --> 00:23:58,710
I'm prepared for it.

426
00:24:01,110 --> 00:24:03,050
So you'd better brace yourself too.

427
00:24:15,330 --> 00:24:16,330
Please.

428
00:24:18,260 --> 00:24:19,260
Don't ruin...

429
00:24:20,830 --> 00:24:22,330
your life any further.

430
00:24:25,040 --> 00:24:27,300
I'm so worried
you'll destroy yourself.

431
00:24:29,770 --> 00:24:30,770
It scares me.

432
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:40,080
Of the ten million dollars you took
through Manager Kang,

433
00:24:42,150 --> 00:24:45,520
this five million remains
after taking out his share.

434
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:48,960
What are you planning to do
with this money?

435
00:24:49,930 --> 00:24:51,060
I'm going to stop Park Tae Ho...

436
00:24:51,060 --> 00:24:53,430
from disrupting
the shareholders' meeting.

437
00:24:53,730 --> 00:24:57,400
It looks like
you have something planned.

438
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:59,800
How can I help you?

439
00:25:00,100 --> 00:25:02,410
Can you move Deputy Chief Yun's
disciplinary hearing...

440
00:25:02,470 --> 00:25:03,840
to an earlier date?

441
00:25:04,740 --> 00:25:06,140
Is that all you need?

442
00:25:06,280 --> 00:25:09,080
Yes. To take down Park Tae Ho,

443
00:25:09,650 --> 00:25:12,320
we need to handle
Deputy Chief Yun too.

444
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:16,090
You're making sure
he can't help Park Tae Ho anymore.

445
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:23,730
Yes, what is it?

446
00:25:24,290 --> 00:25:25,300
What?

447
00:25:25,460 --> 00:25:27,160
The disciplinary hearing's tomorrow?

448
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:29,270
But the audit is still in progress.

449
00:25:30,230 --> 00:25:33,400
The audit is done?
No way, how could it just...

450
00:25:37,340 --> 00:25:38,380
Wait.

451
00:25:38,540 --> 00:25:39,540
Hold on.

452
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:42,480
Does this mean
my police career ends tomorrow?

453
00:25:43,710 --> 00:25:47,950
Darn. I haven't even received
my payout from Park Tae Ho yet.

454
00:25:49,320 --> 00:25:50,750
What about the money...

455
00:25:50,750 --> 00:25:53,390
and the executive position at Adele
I was promised?

456
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,160
Shoot.

457
00:25:58,030 --> 00:25:59,100
Darn it!

458
00:26:06,170 --> 00:26:09,910
Hey, it looks like Deputy Chief Yun
is going to meet Park Tae Ho.

459
00:26:12,710 --> 00:26:14,280
Why haven't I received
the compensation you promised?

460
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:17,610
Whether it's the money
or the executive position at Adele,

461
00:26:17,610 --> 00:26:19,350
just take care of it already.

462
00:26:19,350 --> 00:26:22,120
How dare you make a scene in here?

463
00:26:23,790 --> 00:26:24,990
Wait until...

464
00:26:25,060 --> 00:26:27,960
after the shareholders' meeting,
and my son becomes the chairman.

465
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:31,160
I've waited all this time,
and you're telling me to wait again?

466
00:26:31,230 --> 00:26:32,260
I see.

467
00:26:32,630 --> 00:26:35,400
Once he's chairman, you'll just
come up with another excuse.

468
00:26:36,170 --> 00:26:39,040
Do you take me for a fool
who'll keep falling for it?

469
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:42,810
My police career is ending tomorrow.

470
00:26:42,910 --> 00:26:44,240
Compensate me right now!

471
00:26:44,370 --> 00:26:46,580
I told you
it's not possible right now.

472
00:26:53,420 --> 00:26:56,450
What? How did you get in here?

473
00:26:56,950 --> 00:26:59,090
You must've forgotten
that I used to live here.

474
00:27:04,230 --> 00:27:06,000
I came to make a deal,

475
00:27:06,530 --> 00:27:07,730
so you can stop sweating.

476
00:27:07,930 --> 00:27:10,130
Afraid? Me?

477
00:27:10,330 --> 00:27:14,240
It's half of the ten million dollars
I took from you.

478
00:27:14,940 --> 00:27:15,940
Five million dollars.

479
00:27:17,470 --> 00:27:19,680
What, five million dollars?

480
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:30,690
Don't you ever lay a hand
on Min Jun and Jin Ju again.

481
00:27:31,220 --> 00:27:33,520
- What?
- I'll return the dirty money...

482
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:35,330
I took from you,

483
00:27:36,730 --> 00:27:38,730
so leave Min Jun and Jin Ju alone.

484
00:27:39,430 --> 00:27:42,500
You brought all this money
just for that?

485
00:27:44,330 --> 00:27:47,570
Be honest with me.
What are you trying to pull now?

486
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:50,510
You think my concern
for Min Jun and Jin Ju...

487
00:27:51,210 --> 00:27:53,210
is just a trick? Is that it?

488
00:27:54,110 --> 00:27:56,610
What can I do
when you won't listen to reason?

489
00:28:02,150 --> 00:28:03,490
What do you think you're doing?

490
00:28:03,820 --> 00:28:04,920
Let go right now.

491
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:08,690
No, I'll be taking this money.

492
00:28:10,390 --> 00:28:12,830
You're taking Park Tae Ho's money?

493
00:28:13,230 --> 00:28:16,000
It's money I'm owed,
so it's my money.

494
00:28:17,070 --> 00:28:19,240
Hey. What nonsense is this?

495
00:28:19,870 --> 00:28:22,310
It's only your money
if I give it to you.

496
00:28:24,010 --> 00:28:26,510
I knew it.

497
00:28:26,710 --> 00:28:28,550
Saying you couldn't pay
because you had no money...

498
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:30,080
was all just an excuse.

499
00:28:30,380 --> 00:28:33,320
If you're making this much of a fuss
even when you have the money,

500
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:36,320
it means you never intended
to pay me in the first place.

501
00:28:36,390 --> 00:28:37,390
So...

502
00:28:38,050 --> 00:28:40,120
I'm just taking what I'm owed.

503
00:28:40,660 --> 00:28:41,660
Hey.

504
00:28:42,390 --> 00:28:44,730
Seriously? How dare you?

505
00:28:44,730 --> 00:28:45,860
Darn it!

506
00:28:47,230 --> 00:28:48,230
You punk.

507
00:28:48,570 --> 00:28:50,400
How dare you? Let go.

508
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:52,040
Let go. Get your hands off it.

509
00:28:53,870 --> 00:28:56,310
- Why you...
- I said, let go!

510
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:01,850
You haven't heard anything else
from your mother, have you?

511
00:29:02,280 --> 00:29:05,250
No, but things are going smoothly
on her end.

512
00:29:09,950 --> 00:29:11,520
Get your hands off it.

513
00:29:12,460 --> 00:29:14,020
Right back at you, punk.

514
00:29:14,320 --> 00:29:18,230
No one gets to take my money
without my permission.

515
00:29:18,230 --> 00:29:20,400
When you hire someone,

516
00:29:20,460 --> 00:29:22,430
you have to pay for their services.

517
00:29:22,730 --> 00:29:26,300
I got into this mess helping you
stop that police investigation.

518
00:29:26,670 --> 00:29:28,610
Since you got me fired
from the police force,

519
00:29:29,010 --> 00:29:31,370
the least you can do is give me
the money you promised!

520
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,480
My money...

521
00:29:38,350 --> 00:29:41,250
Hey. Get up, you punk.

522
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:43,220
That's enough!

523
00:29:49,060 --> 00:29:50,290
Park Tae Ho!

524
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:01,910
That's got to hurt.

525
00:30:03,540 --> 00:30:06,180
But we're not done yet.

526
00:30:07,010 --> 00:30:08,380
What? What now?

527
00:30:13,980 --> 00:30:16,390
Mr. Park Tae Ho, you are under
emergency arrest for soliciting...

528
00:30:16,450 --> 00:30:17,790
the murder of Baek Jun Gi
seven years ago...

529
00:30:17,850 --> 00:30:18,860
and the attempted murder
of Baek Jin Ju.

530
00:30:20,690 --> 00:30:24,830
What's going on?
Let go of me. Let go!

531
00:30:25,230 --> 00:30:29,100
They already closed that case,
concluding that Choi Sam Sik did it.

532
00:30:29,370 --> 00:30:31,700
What is the meaning of this?

533
00:30:31,830 --> 00:30:34,500
We submitted additional evidence.

534
00:30:35,140 --> 00:30:38,440
What? Evidence?
What kind of evidence?

535
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:41,440
You can find out all about it
at the police station.

536
00:30:44,150 --> 00:30:46,680
And while you're at it, arrest...

537
00:30:47,180 --> 00:30:49,650
Deputy Chief Yun Hyeong Su
of the National Police Agency.

538
00:30:51,120 --> 00:30:52,690
Me? Why me?

539
00:30:59,230 --> 00:31:03,070
When you hire someone,
you have to pay for their services.

540
00:31:03,570 --> 00:31:06,940
I got into this mess helping you
stop that police investigation.

541
00:31:07,340 --> 00:31:09,370
Since you got me fired
from the police force,

542
00:31:09,710 --> 00:31:12,080
the least you can do is give me
the money you promised!

543
00:31:13,910 --> 00:31:16,510
As for the investigation
he helped block,

544
00:31:17,080 --> 00:31:18,380
you can look into that too.

545
00:31:18,750 --> 00:31:21,450
And all this cash scattered here...

546
00:31:21,750 --> 00:31:23,720
will serve as additional evidence.

547
00:32:07,930 --> 00:32:10,700
(Pearl in Red)

548
00:32:11,100 --> 00:32:13,200
What?
Father was taken by the police?

549
00:32:13,440 --> 00:32:15,710
This isn't just
about simple bribery.

550
00:32:15,910 --> 00:32:18,110
That case seven years ago,
the whole Choi Sam Sik situation...

551
00:32:18,410 --> 00:32:19,780
It could all come out.

552
00:32:19,780 --> 00:32:22,280
I have to make use
of the slush fund ledger.

553
00:32:22,280 --> 00:32:24,480
Just do exactly as I say.

554
00:32:24,780 --> 00:32:27,380
I, Park Tae Ho,
will step up and fix this.

555
00:32:27,650 --> 00:32:28,650
Yu Na.

556
00:32:29,090 --> 00:32:30,650
Please, I'm begging you.

557
00:32:30,650 --> 00:32:33,260
Cut ties with Park Tae Ho's family.

558
00:32:33,260 --> 00:32:36,030
No. It's you I'm cutting ties with.

559
00:32:36,090 --> 00:32:38,860
I don't have a mom or a dad anymore!

560
00:32:39,560 --> 00:32:41,560
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
